  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="team-cost"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">02 / Put a number on the purchase</p><h2>LinkedIn automation prices<br>for 1, 3 and 5 senders.</h2><p><strong>Monthly list prices for the named setup.</strong> One sender means one connected LinkedIn account. USD unless marked EUR. Tax, LinkedIn subscriptions and extra credits are separate. Annual prices appear in the reviews.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table sg-table sg-costs" role="table"><caption>Monthly sender costs before promotions or negotiated discounts</caption><thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Tool and setup</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">1 sender</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">3 senders</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">5 senders</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for p in guide.providers %}{% if p.costs %}<tr role="row" data-cost-id="{{ p.id }}"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="#{{ p.id }}">{{ p.name }}</a><small>{{ p.costPlan }}<br>{{ p.costNote }}</small></th>{% for amount in p.costs %}<td role="cell" data-label="{{ [1,3,5][loop.index0] }} {% if loop.first %}sender{% else %}senders{% endif %}">{{ p.symbol }}{{ amount }}{% if p.currency == "EUR" %}<small>EUR</small>{% endif %}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
    <div class="la-workspace-cost"><h3>PhantomBuster charges for a shared workspace.</h3><p><strong>Start: $69/month.</strong> Includes five automation slots and 20 hours of execution time per month. Grow is $159 for 15 slots and 80 hours; Scale is $439 for 50 slots and 300 hours.</p><p>Connected LinkedIn accounts share these allowances. Budget for the running time your campaigns need.</p><a href="#phantombuster">Read the PhantomBuster verdict →</a></div>
    <p class="sg-sources">Replacing an existing workflow? Compare <a href="/resources/phantombuster-alternatives/">PhantomBuster alternatives for exports, enrichment and outreach</a>, with the extra purchases each option needs.</p>
    <div class="sg-two sg-after"><div><h3>Team management can change the bill.</h3><p>Meet Alfred Agency is $79 per seat monthly with a three-seat minimum: <strong>$237 for one to three senders, or $395 for five.</strong> Its Multi-Channel row above excludes Agency team controls. Dripify's row includes Advanced for every sender; its review shows a cheaper mixed-plan setup.</p></div><div><h3>Check optional tools before adding them.</h3><p>Sales Navigator adds research features and its own subscription. Email finders, enrichment, separate email-sending tools and inbox add-ons can also increase the total. Waalaxy's row includes its paid Inbox; its five-seat discount needs a support code.</p></div></div>
    <div class="sg-note"><strong>Does the upgrade earn its cost?</strong> Ask which task it removes and who will use it. A large company needs the same answers. More seats, AI features and personalisation can make a weak campaign more expensive.</div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta"><p><strong>Already have the people you want to reach?</strong> CallTeam can prepare the calling list, speak with prospects and follow up on the right opportunities.</p><a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="linkedin-automation-costs">Talk to CallTeam ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>

